{"w":2400,"lines":[{"x":0.085436895120553843,"w":0.11456310272216798,"h":0.01308139551465759,"c":1,"t":"Introduction","y":0.043604651065661582},{"t":"MARKING THE PRACTICE TESTS","w":0.43132120768229165,"h":0.018772472250869976,"y":0.089493442861365624,"c":1,"x":0.089194128068926654},{"h":0.020648181475582894,"w":0.25086713155110674,"c":1,"y":0.12854607907500615,"t":"Listening and Reading","x":0.087188808920039426},{"w":0.3747572835286459,"y":0.15406976728001398,"x":0.087378640640017449,"h":0.017581322928455378,"t":"The answer keys are on pages 119-126.","c":1},{"y":0.17139780238258839,"t":"Each question in the Listening and Reading tests is worth one mark.","c":1,"x":0.089197637084014472,"w":0.61381495157877608,"h":0.021095713202455624},{"t":"Questions which require letter \/ Roman numeral answers","h":0.021265178454627831,"c":1,"y":0.20978262106552237,"w":0.53819035847981778,"x":0.089150566510652715},{"w":0.81770721435546867,"x":0.087278254738307248,"t":"For questions where the answers are letters or Roman numerals, you should write only the","c":1,"h":0.022269501492984567,"y":0.2324298185451531},{"w":0.80024464925130201,"c":1,"t":"number of answers required. For example, if the answer is a single letter or numeral, you","y":0.25144399300753006,"h":0.022276724461825825,"x":0.089200115800780203},{"y":0.27025750237364066,"x":0.089213241448174857,"t":"should write only one answer. If you have written more letters or numerals than are required,","c":1,"w":0.83318379720052083,"h":0.021089752292336006},{"w":0.32233009338378904,"c":1,"y":0.29215116272754249,"h":0.015988371899566145,"t":"the answer must be marked wrong.","x":0.087378644259561752},{"w":0.62162765502929695,"c":1,"x":0.091122040900167414,"y":0.32768637658245292,"h":0.020848247492424754,"t":"Questions which require answers in the form of words or numbers"},{"y":0.35270159607973639,"t":"• Answers may be written in upper or lower case.","h":0.018629043198820083,"c":1,"x":0.087284820265716781,"w":0.46037155151367187},{"c":1,"h":0.016199376947040545,"x":0.087378652362016335,"y":0.37196261655353635,"t":"• Words in brackets are optional - they are correct, but not necessary.","w":0.64660191853841142},{"h":0.016011011711904888,"c":1,"t":"• Alternative answers are separated by a slash ().","x":0.087378645604976976,"y":0.3909657323656569,"w":0.46990290323893225},{"t":"• If you are asked to write an answer using a certain number of words and\/or (a) number(s),","h":0.021389827550014617,"c":1,"x":0.08728741930221455,"w":0.84093577067057301,"y":0.40615257848507658},{"y":0.42512526709707654,"w":0.7867134602864585,"h":0.022155444421500747,"c":1,"x":0.11634672004696947,"t":"you will be penalised if you exceed this. For example, if a question specifies an answer"},{"t":"using NO MORE THAN THREE WORDS and the correct answer is 'black leather coat,","y":0.44260856504663626,"x":0.11832992846708218,"h":0.02269938103506508,"w":0.7846547444661458,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.46510903420744831,"w":0.40970873514811196,"t":"the answer 'coat of black leather' is incorrect.","x":0.11650485566197981,"h":0.015995616853422878},{"w":0.79243642171223949,"y":0.48102029872491792,"c":1,"x":0.08728030493470991,"h":0.021379467260057683,"t":"• In questions where you are expected to complete a gap, you should only transfer the"},{"h":0.023108535243714701,"y":0.49941406835825997,"t":"necessary missing word(s) onto the answer sheet. For example, to complete 'in the ...',","w":0.7847624206542968,"c":1,"x":0.11829915930572629},{"x":0.11819744981746898,"c":1,"w":0.76740809122721365,"h":0.027787783138477185,"y":0.51536007382924831,"t":"where the correct answer is 'morning', the answer 'in the morning' would be incorrect."},{"c":1,"t":"• All answers require correct spelling (including words in brackets).","w":0.61761296590169268,"h":0.019272918938847639,"y":0.53905541909464705,"x":0.087305164238759309},{"h":0.021066652577242717,"y":0.55647804755333696,"c":1,"t":"• Both US and UK spelling are acceptable and are included in the answer key.","w":0.71866592407226559,"x":0.089197596424518313},{"c":1,"y":0.57533095994763883,"w":0.70900817871093746,"x":0.089181222562518106,"h":0.023096062015521501,"t":"• All standard alternatives for numbers, dates and currencies are acceptable."},{"y":0.59738372063474221,"h":0.014534884301301454,"x":0.08932038483613762,"w":0.41165049235026036,"t":"• All standard abbreviations are acceptable.","c":1},{"h":0.017469028223340732,"y":0.61337209328887521,"c":1,"x":0.089320405057850868,"w":0.68349512736002604,"t":"• You will find additional notes about individual answers in the answer key."},{"t":"Writing","w":0.085954221089680982,"h":0.023399433837130057,"x":0.090107211972192097,"c":1,"y":0.64435546521308906},{"t":"The sample and model answers are on pages 127-137. It is not possible for you to give","w":0.79043273925781243,"h":0.020116827421099215,"x":0.09119342098766102,"y":0.67056154715353455,"c":1},{"w":0.75369298299153642,"t":"yourself a mark for the Writing tasks. We have provided sample answers (written by","y":0.68964919857900342,"x":0.091112642824919682,"h":0.021438749556972225,"c":1},{"t":"candidates), showing their score and the examiners' comments. We have also provided","w":0.78679117838541668,"h":0.024980402438440019,"x":0.093021182650446121,"y":0.7055001686431196,"c":1},{"t":"high-level model answers written by examiners. Additional sample and model answers can","x":0.093068019846753128,"h":0.021224980339454302,"y":0.72625618809906245,"w":0.81386291503906238,"c":1},{"h":0.019191458514917659,"c":1,"x":0.093151758052433614,"w":0.82923014322916677,"t":"be downloaded from the Resource Bank. These sample and model answers will give you an","y":0.74544471901159437},{"y":0.76650413231726366,"x":0.091167513068612038,"t":"insight into what is required for the Writing test.","w":0.42928721110026047,"h":0.018582246013890913,"c":1},{"x":0.093203883841845372,"h":0.014534883112922281,"w":0.015533979733784994,"c":1,"t":"8","y":0.95930232574005048}],"h":3209}